Gridcheck is a test harness for EVE.js, an EVE Online server emulator, and runs inside an EVE.js
server process. EVE.js is licensed AGPL-3.0, and the harness is licensed the same way. The
destiny decoder in bridge/destiny.js mirrors EVE.js's ball encoding, and the bridge calls EVE.js
modules from the tree it is installed in. That server code is EVE.js's work.

plugins/lu is the half of the harness for the X-Eve Living Universe mod, a fork of EVE.js.

